{
  "title": "Process Overview - 1.4) Good to know | Definition",
  "description": {
    "goodToKnow": "A billing correction is a scenario where an initial billing document from different end-to-end (E2E) processes must be corrected through a subsequent billing document.",
    "twoItemCorrection": {
      "definition": "In the 2-line correction (known as Faktura Correcta (2-item)), there is no need to distinguish between value/quantity or a full correction, as the 2-item variant works like a full correction by design.",
